      "value": "@{5d101e50428ccc1668e70d7c|full_name}: The only method right now of doing this stuff would be to use the FinalIK Grounder component to raycast the effects to the PlayerLocal and Player layers. It works if you want to shoot someone, but the bigger problem is if you want to use something like an arcade cabinet to do a dumb FNAF jumpscare from the machine",
